<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Deutsche, Commerzbank, Dresdner.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Deutsche, Commerzbank, Dresdner.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>JP Morgan said on Tuesday it had inititated coverage of Germany's Deutsche Bank, Commerzbank and Dresdner Bank as &quot;market performers&quot;.</p>
<p>It said the recent Vereinsbank-Hypobank merger would create pressure on their rivals to unlock shareholder value, but argued the three were overvalued by between 10 percent and 27 percent, according to valuation work by JP Morgan analysts.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
